Name: roi-selector
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Cross-platform PyQt6 ROI selector for NumPy image stacks, designed for Jupyter notebooks. Select, move, resize and zoom a pixel-accurate ROI in an isolated child process, then crop entire stacks with the chosen region.
Requires-Python: >=3.9
